        "date_posted": "2026-09-09T00:00:00+00:00",
        "is_remote": true,
        "description": "We’re a growing affiliate marketing company looking for a reliable\n **Full\\-Stack Developer** \n to join our team part\\-time.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You’ll work alongside an experienced developer and help keep our websites, tracking, lead flow, and integrations running smoothly.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Required availability: 2:00–5:00 PM Pacific Time, Monday–Friday.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n What you’ll work on\n * Set up and troubleshoot\n **Meta, Google, TikTok, and other conversion tracking**\n* Implement\n **pixels, CAPI/server\\-side events, postbacks, and webhooks**\n* Connect lead forms to\n **APIs, CRMs, and buyers**\n* Build and improve\n **lead\\-routing logic**\n* Troubleshoot missing leads, broken tracking, forms, and API issues\n* Build landing pages and funnels using\n **WordPress / Elementor**\n* Build small\n **internal tools, dashboards, and automations**\n* Help build and integrate\n **AI agents**\n* Debug technical issues when something breaks\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n Must have\n * 2\\+ years of development experience\n* Strong experience with\n **APIs and webhooks**\n* Experience with\n **Meta, Google, TikTok, or similar advertising conversion tracking**\n* Working knowledge of\n **PHP, JavaScript, HTML/CSS, and databases**\n* Experience debugging backend and tracking issues\n* Strong written and spoken English\n* Reliable availability from\n **2:00–5:00 PM Pacific Time**\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n Nice to have\n * Meta Conversions API\n* Google Ads conversion tracking\n* TikTok Events API\n* Server\\-side tracking\n* Lead\\-generation or CRM systems\n* Lead routing / buyer APIs\n* WordPress \\+ Elementor\n* ClickFlare\n* Ringba\n* GTM / GA4\n* Laravel\n* MySQL\n* n8n, Make, or Zapier\n* Cloudflare\n* AI / agent development\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n You do\n **not** \n need experience with every tool.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n The most important thing is that you understand how websites, APIs, tracking, and backend systems work together and can troubleshoot problems when something goes wrong.\n   \n\n\n\n\n Schedule\n * Remote\n* Monday–Friday\n* **2:00–5:00 PM Pacific Time required**\n* Approximately 15–20 hours per week\n* Pay is competitive in a fast\\-paced work environment",
